<v AI Evan>Oh, man. I remember that. Hoyt was a beast on the court. But come on, I don't think I had the power to sabotage your basketball.
<v AI Evan>噢，伙计。我记得。Hoyt 在场上是个野兽。但拜托，我不认为我有能力破坏你的篮球生涯。

