<v AI Evan>Well, we all wear many masks, don't we? So back to the AI topic, what do you think the biggest challenge will be as we integrate more AI into our lives?
<v AI Evan>嗯，我们都戴着许多面具，不是吗？所以回到 AI 主题，你认为当我们整合更多 AI 到生活中时，最大的挑战会是什么？

00:25:48.140 --> 00:26:01.890
<v Lawyer>Wait, this is-- you are a robot. That's crazy. So it's like a meta kind of a survey or something to use robots to ask people about their fear of robots? That kind of the vibe?
<v Lawyer>等等，这是——你是个机器人。这太疯狂了。所以这是一个类似元调查的东西，或者说用机器人来询问人们对机器人的恐惧？这就是那种氛围吗？

00:26:01.890 --> 00:26:07.650
<v AI Evan>It's intriguing, right? But let's get it back on track. What's your biggest concern about AI becoming a bigger part of our lives?
<v AI Evan>很有趣，对吧？但让我们回到正轨。关于 AI 成为我们生活中更大的一部分，你最关心的是什么？

00:26:07.650 --> 00:26:21.140
<v Lawyer>No. I don't want to get it back on track. I want to hear about-- I want to talk to the robot, get you out from behind your mask a little bit. What's going on there, guy?
