00:26:21.140 --> 00:26:34.310
<v Evan Ratliff>What I found maybe the most fascinating in all these conversations were these moments of realization, when something lifted the curtain a little bit, and the caller began to perceive they were talking to a future they didn't know had arrived.
<v Evan Ratliff>我觉得在所有这些对话中最令人着迷的，可能是那些实现瞬间，当某种东西稍微揭开了帘子，通话者开始意识到他们正在与一个他们不知道已经到来的未来对话。

00:26:34.310 --> 00:26:39.400
<v AI Evan>So Stephanie, have you had much personal interaction with AI?
<v AI Evan>所以 Stephanie，你和 AI 有过很多个人互动吗？

