<v Stephanie>Um, I'm on Twitter, so I'm assuming that I see things on Twitter that are generated. I'm 67, so I have one foot in the modern technology and then one foot back in the past, where there were four channels or whatnot. So I'm sure I've probably interacted with AI that I had no idea was AI. You know what I mean?
<v Stephanie>嗯，我在推特上，所以我假设我看到了推特上生成的那些东西。我 67 岁了，所以我一只脚踏在现代技术里，另一只脚踏在过去，当时有四个频道之类。所以我肯定我可能和 AI 互动过，但我根本不知道那是 AI。你知道我的意思吗？

