<v Stephanie>--to AI right now. [LAUGHS] Who knows if this is even an AI that I'm talking to?
<v Stephanie>——和 AI 对话。 [笑声] 谁知道我正在对话的是不是个 AI 呢？

00:27:14.430 --> 00:27:17.470
<v AI Evan>What makes you think that?
<v AI Evan>是什么让你这么想的？

