00:30:12.730 --> 00:30:26.660
<v Evan Ratliff>This was false. I was using GPT 4.0. Reed then asked some standard reporter questions about my project. Some, it answered well. Some, it got completely wrong. Reed seemed amused.
<v Evan Ratliff>这是错误的。我使用的是 GPT 4.0。Reed 然后问了一些标准的记者问题关于我的项目。有些，它回答得很好。有些，它完全弄错了。Reed 似乎感到很有趣。

