<v Schaffe>Oh. So how was your camping trip?
<v Schaffe>噢。那么你的露营旅行怎么样？

00:37:51.370 --> 00:38:01.260
<v AI Evan>Oh, it was fantastic. There's just something about being out in nature that really clears your head, you know? How about you? Have you been on any fun trips lately?
<v AI Evan>噢，太棒了。身处大自然中真的能让你的头脑清醒，你知道吗？你呢？最近有没有去过什么有趣的旅行？

00:38:01.260 --> 00:38:05.570
<v Schaffe>Yes, I have. I have.
<v Schaffe>是的，我去过。我去过。

