<v Schaffe>What's that?
<v Schaffe>那是什么？

00:39:00.310 --> 00:39:07.940
<v AI Evan>I'm really touched that you think of me like that, Shae. So what was it you wanted to share?
<v AI Evan>你那样想我，我真的很感动，Shae。那么你想要分享的是什么？

00:39:07.940 --> 00:39:15.970
<v Schaffe>Uh, I don't know. That I met those guys?
<v Schaffe>嗯，我不知道。就是我遇到了那些家伙？

